# 04 — SLAM map building
# SLAM se naya map banao aur save karo.
# Start SLAM, drive a small exploration loop, then save the map.

robot jodo "turtlebot"
map banao
dikhao "Mapping shuru. Robot thoda ghoomega."

# Ek chhota chakkar / a small square exploration loop
har side [1, 2, 3, 4] mein karo
    aage chalo 1 meter
    ghumo 90 degree
    ruko 1 second
khatam

# Thoda aur cover karo / cover a little more area
aage chalo 2 meter
ghumo 45 degree
aage chalo 1 meter
ruk jao

map save "lab"
dikhao "Map save ho gaya: lab"
robot chhodo
